#: ../../source/index.rst:5
#: 58816eb9227f4602818f2bbea0233e8d
msgid "ArduPilot Plane"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:18
#: de1ef38f08a443a4a0bff511a74d90d5
msgid "The open source Plane firmware running on a compatible controller board gives any fixed-wing aircraft full autonomous capability. VTOL fixed-wing aircraft that hover and cruise in different configurations are also included under the Plane firmware."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:23
#: 148681bcd02e4879b7d0b906d5126bcb
msgid "Plane provides advanced functions such as support for hundreds of three-dimensional waypoints, automatic take-off and landing as well as sophisticated mission planning and camera controls. It works with a variety of :ref:`Ground Control Station <common-choosing-a-ground-station>` (GCS) software for programming and mission operations and offers a complete UAV solution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:29
#: 2ae5d2dd4e244ba68774fe0fe1158dc1
msgid "The entire package is designed to be easily approachable for the novice, while remaining open-ended for custom applications, education, and research use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:35
#: 9f1c4540e66a46bf8ae8a336270ad98c
msgid "This is the platform that won the prestigious `Outback Challenge UAV competition <http://uavchallenge.org>`__ in `2012 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/canberrauav-outback-challenge-2012-debrief>`__, `2014 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/canberrauav-outback-challenge-2014-debrief>`__ and `2016 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/canberrauav-outback-challenge-2016-debrief/12162>`__ as well as the `2014 Sparkfun Autonomous Vehicle Competition <https://avc.sparkfun.com/2014/scores#Aerial:Fixed>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:45
#: f4edb5f7ec9542518cd773a77ec17554
msgid "Keep up with the latest ArduPilot related blogs on `ArduPilot.org! <https://ardupilot.org/>`__"
msgstr ""

